1. OVERVIEW

Rex ("Software") is a custom-developed, proprietary software
utility distributed in compiled binary form.

The Software is made publicly available for educational,
research, and authorized cybersecurity activities, including
participation in the Collegiate Penetration Testing Competition
(CPTC).

Public availability does not constitute an open-source release,
a transfer of ownership, or a waiver of intellectual property
rights.

All rights not expressly granted under this License are reserved
by the copyright holders.


